<title>JAPAN: Asahi Breweries rises to 1997 high.</title>
<headline>Asahi Breweries rises to 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Breweries Ltd's shares rose to a high for the calendar year on Tuesday, as investors sought domestic-demand related issues, brokers said.</p>
<p>By midday, the shares had gained 50 yen to 1,500, a new high for the year. Turnover was 2.12 million shares.</p>
<p>Brokers said that in addition to the domestic-demand trend, investors were attracted to the issue on speculation that its sales figures would be solid.</p>
